<item><title>Two Labour MPs quit Somaliland group over Israel and chair’s party ties</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/two-labour-mps-quit-somaliland-group-over-israel-and-chair-22184d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/two-labour-mps-quit-somaliland-group-over-israel-and-chair-22184d/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>A third Labour MP has suspended her involvement, citing the chair’s link to Restore Britain and the group’s direction after Israel recognised Somaliland.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:15:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Gargash rejects Somalia president’s claims of UAE interference</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/gargash-rejects-somalia-president-s-claims-of-uae-c264a8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/gargash-rejects-somalia-president-s-claims-of-uae-c264a8/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>The UAE diplomatic adviser said the president’s criticism reflected shifting positions, after Somalia annulled port and security agreements in January.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:52:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/gargash-rejects-somalia-president-s-claims-of-uae-c264a8/share.jpg" length="43090" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/gargash-rejects-somalia-president-s-claims-of-uae-c264a8/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
